{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Track and hunt bunnies in the woods with your bow. It\u2019s what the King demands.</u></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/hunt.gif?t=1740760178\" /><br><br><strong><u>Load the catapult and hurl them into the castle. No one will thank you.</u></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/catapult.gif?t=1740760178\" /><br><br><strong><u>Things tend to get stranger\u2026 and far more dangerous.</u></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/ia.gif?t=1740760178\" /><br><br><strong>Do you think you can satisfy the King's desires? He\u2019s not known for his mercy.</strong><br><br>IN BUNNY HURLING, YOU CAN...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move stealthily and wait for the perfect moment to <strong>shoot the arrow!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lure bunnies with a <strong>bunny call</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be wary of <strong>creatures and vengeful ghosts</strong>! You aren't the only alpha predator in the forest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely explore a large <strong>nonlinear map filled</strong> with educational bunny facts and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight the King!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515620?t=1740760178","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515620?t=1740760178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/3dbc63e7653716e9be25c1648db7de5fe9485d70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740760178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/3dbc63e7653716e9be25c1648db7de5fe